      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contoocook%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Contoocook River winds through the village center, while the Warner River borders the north, joining the Contoocook.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contoocook%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Contoocook hosts the world’s oldest surviving covered railroad bridge, a relic of 19th‑century rail travel.",
